AT Protocol Spaces (the permissioned-data alpha), copied unmodified from the
reference implementation, at the same commit vlpds 1.1.0 tracks:

  repo:   https://github.com/bluesky-social/atproto
  branch: permissioned-data (PR #5187)
  commit: 5b95b2f2723a2882824fbb0b819fd6aad884ef20
  paths:  packages/space/{src,tests,package.json,tsconfig*.json,vitest.config.ts}
          lexicons/com/atproto/space/*.json        (20 methods + defs)
          lexicons/com/atproto/simplespace/*.json  (8 methods + defs)

Local additions: tests/vectors.test.ts and tests/vectors/ (vlpds's vectors,
see tests/vectors/SOURCE). The reference's matching changes outside this
package were ported too: VerifyOptions.format in @atproto/crypto and the
untyped input of isValidDid in @atproto/syntax.

Upstream breaks the wire weekly. To update: pick the commit vlpds tracks
(lexicons/spaces-alpha/SOURCE in mexico-parasocial/vlpds), copy both trees from
it, port what it needs outside packages/space, take vlpds's vectors from the
same vlpds commit, run `pnpm codegen`, and update this file.

